  "details": "The \"asdfghjkl;'\" row of keys on the keyboard are not staggered the way they are on a normal keyboard, leading to frequent typos with this set of keys.\n\nI very much appreciate the desire to re-implement keys like \"`\" and \"\\\", but I feel like the comfortable layout of the alphabetical keys should be prioritized over the position of these lesser used keys.\n\nI'm not pitching for them to be removed again, but urging to consider moving them to different spots on the keyboard that still allows for the \"main\" set of keys to be laid out in a familiar way.",
